# A command that runs past its deadline (D1 round 6): the row, Ctrl-O live,
# and what the model was sent. fx's `shell` takes a per-call `timeout_ms`, so
# its command is given one second; xfx's `terminal` has a fixed two-minute
# ceiling, so its command runs past that.
fx: gateway timeout-fx.json
xfx: gateway timeout-xfx.json
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
wait 4
type run the slow one
key Enter
fx: wait 4
xfx: wait 125
snap live
key C-o
wait 1.5
snap live-ctrl-o
key Escape
wait 1
gwlog
